summary:
  A dated order gets no age until audio arrives.

history:
  A press at eleven with the lid shut before the connect left nothing to
  measure, and the heal at eight played the station.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
      function _orderDated() { root._orderQuietSince = 0; root._orderHeardAt = Date.now(); }

replace:
      function _orderDated() { root._orderQuietSince = 0; root._orderHeardAt = 0; }

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_person_giving_the_order_dates_it_afresh.
  Line-neutral.
